

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/DarkMage/scr.rpy:7
translate es qst_guild_darkmage_5d83c0bd:

    # "...Before taking the quest, the guild ensured we were looked over and were fully rested before allowing us to take the quest."
    "...Antes de aceptar la misión, el gremio se aseguró de que nos examinaran y estuviéramos totalmente descansados."

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/DarkMage/scr.rpy:9
translate es qst_guild_darkmage_08612603:

    # "Piecing together what we could from the reports on the dark Mage, we knew the dark mage was likely hiding somewhere within the southern housing district."
    "Recopilando lo que pudimos de los informes sobre el mago oscuro, supimos que probablemente se escondía en algún lugar del distrito de viviendas del sur."

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/DarkMage/scr.rpy:14
translate es qst_guild_darkmage_c97210ec:

    # "While I didn't possess any magic, there was a distinctly foul 'scent' that stood out amongst the rest, and the more I focused in on, the more I suspected it would lead us to the Mage."
    "Aunque no poseía ningún tipo de magia, había un 'olor' claramente nauseabundo que destacaba entre los demás, y cuanto más me concentraba en él, más sospechaba que nos llevaría hasta el mago."

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/DarkMage/scr.rpy:15
translate es qst_guild_darkmage_8f394de5:

    # BLACK "{i}Death ... I smell Death.{/i}"
    BLACK "{i}Muerte... huelo a muerte.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/DarkMage/scr.rpy:16
translate es qst_guild_darkmage_b2343654:

    # MC "(Are you sure you aren't just going to lead us to a crypt?)"
    MC "(¿Seguro que no va a llevar a una cripta?)"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/DarkMage/scr.rpy:17
translate es qst_guild_darkmage_fca93e35:

    # MC "(This city isn't exactly short on death)."
    MC "(A esta ciudad no le falta precisamente muerte)."

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/DarkMage/scr.rpy:18
translate es qst_guild_darkmage_1bbddebc:

    # BLACK "{i}Different ... Smell not right.{/i}"
    BLACK "{i}Diferente ... no huele bien.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/DarkMage/scr.rpy:19
